Derek: For the retry header issue, here's the minimal patch I tested locally (node express):

```
// ensure trace header persists across internal retries
const retry = require('promise-retry');
app.use((req, res, next) => {
  req._origTrace = req.header('traceparent');
  next();
});
// when retrying, restore header
function sendWithRetry(opts) {
  return retry((r, num) => {
    opts.headers['traceparent'] = opts.headers['traceparent'] || opts._origTrace;
    return send(opts).catch(r);
  });
}
```

Jules: Nice. Push as small patch behind FF. Also adding a drop-rate alert: `alert if span_drop_rate > 0.3% for 10m` and an annotation on the dashboard for the incident window.

